# 44-recents-seed: a LEGACY session pointer (pre-261012-h26 shape: only `collection = Original`, no
# `recent` lines - pre-seeded into this script's sandbox by the CI step, scripts cannot write files
# before start) seeds the recents list at startup (v2.6 REC-02), and the stored collection name is
# never blanked.
app.expect recents=Original
app.expect collections=Original
app.quit force
